# ANTIGRAVITY AGENT AUTONOMOUS OPERATING CORE
# Single Source of Truth: PROJECT_RULES.md

See PROJECT_RULES.md and .agents/AGENTS.md for full details.

1. GSD (Get Shit Done) Protocol:
   - Perform dependency check and document micro-atomic plan in PLAN.md / implementation_plan.md.
   - Require explicit user approval before writing code.

2. Ralph Loop Execution:
   - Single task focus.
   - Execute unit tests (pytest), linters (npm run lint), and builds (next build) after every change.

3. CodeRabbit Compliance Guard:
   - Audit diffs for edge cases, algorithmic complexity, zero hardcoded secrets, and strict data type safety.
